WEBVTT

00:16:29.246 --> 00:16:32.454
the best of themselves to work, I found
a powerful, key contributor,

00:16:32.954 --> 00:16:37.704
individualized consideration when people
are allowed to feel their emotional

00:16:37.704 --> 00:16:41.954
truth. Engagement, creativity
and innovation flourish in

00:16:41.954 --> 00:16:47.371
the organization. Diversity isn't just
people, it's also what's inside people,

00:16:47.954 --> 00:16:49.871
including diversity of emotion.

00:16:52.871 --> 00:16:58.121
The most agile, resilient individuals,
teams, organizations, families,

00:16:58.121 --> 00:17:01.787
communities are built on an openness
to the normal human emotions.